FeatureName: Keyboard Shortcuts

Description:
	Allows the user to control the paint app using various keyboard shortcuts rather than relying on mouse interaction.
	This feature has been added as an accessibility feature for users with limited motor control due to issues such as:
	ALS, hand tremors, and general limited hand movement. Furthermore, this feature also fosters users who prefer faster
	interaction with the application.

	The list of keyboard shortcuts is below:
	Undo -> Ctrl+Z
	Redo -> Ctrl+Y
	Delete -> Delete
	Increasing/Decreasing stroke size: +\-
	Change mode(Fill/Outline) -> M

    Later on do Copy and paste, once implemented


