FeatureName: Opacity Controller

Description:
	Allows the user to select an opacity for the chosen color.

Reference:
	US3.018
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Eraser

Description:
	Allows the user to select an eraser option and then delete shapes that the cursor overlaps during a mouse drag.
Reference:
	US3.019
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Delete

Description:
	Allows the user to delete the last drawn shape on the board. The user can delete shapes until the canvas reaches its
	initial state(empty canvas).
Reference:
	US3.020
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Undo

Description:
	Allows the user to restore the canvas to an immediately previous state. For example: if a shape was deleted the user
	could use undo to restore the shape, or on the contrary if a shape was added the user could use undo to remove the
	shape. The user can undo until the canvas reaches its initial state(empty canvas).
Reference:
	US3.021
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Redo

Description:
	Allows the user to restore the canvas to a state that was previously undone. The redo button reverses the action of
	an undo. For example: if a user performed an undo operation to remove a shape, then a redo operation adds the shape
	to the board. The user can redo until they reach the most recent state of the canvas(no undo operations performed).
Reference:
	US3.022
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Dark Mode

Description:
	Allows the user to change the canvas to dark mode if they wish to(UI preference). The dark mode changes the canvas
	to a darker color and also updates the eraser to handle erasing on a dark canvas.
Reference:
	US3.023
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Text mode

Description:
	Allows the user to add custom text on the canvas using an input box. The text is added at the mousePressed position
	and the user is able to control the size and color of the text using the thickness and color selector.
Reference:
	US3.024
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Color Friendly Palette

Description:
	Implementing a color friendly palette for people with vision impairment problems(Deuteranopia, Protanopia and
	general low vision). This feature has been added as an accessibility feature to allow users with Deuteranopia(Red-
	Green color blindness), Protanopia(Red color blindness) and general low vision to be able to use the paint app
	effectively.

Reference:
	US3.025
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeatureName: Multiple Canvases

Description:
	Allows the user to add another tab with another blank canvas to continue drawing there without impacting the
	drawings on the first canvas.
